{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "516b454d-79ac-8cfb-877a-62f5d99f3f5d",
  "created_at": "2026-01-05T14:06:46-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Beatriz Castillo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:04:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise, good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:04:58-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. I'm calling about a pothole. A big one. My tire blew out in it on Saturday and the rim is bent, so now I'm out a wheel and..."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:05:08-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh no, I'm sorry. Where is the pothole, hon?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:05:12-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's at 158 Callender Avenue, right out front of my shop. It's right in the bike lane, if you can believe it. Right in the bike lane."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:05:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 158 Callender, North End. Let me get that down. Can I get your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:05:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Beatriz Castillo. Castillo, with two L's, like the... well, you know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:05:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can you spell it for me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:05:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "C, A, S, T, I, double L, O."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:05:36-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "C-A-S-T-I... okay, and was that a double L, or a Y? Sometimes I hear those wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:05:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, not a Y. L. L as in... as in Larry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:05:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, double L. Castillo. And a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:05:51-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0156."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:05:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0156. Perfect. I'll put in the request for the crew to look at that pothole in the bike lane."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:05:59-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "How long does it usually take? To fix them? Because I've seen that hole for weeks, honestly, and nobody..."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:06:06-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It varies. Winter's tough because the crews patch with cold mix and it's busy, but a hole like that, in a bike lane, they'll want to get to fairly quickly. Could be a few days, could be a couple of weeks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:06:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A couple of weeks. Hm. That's not very quick."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:06:23-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I know. I'll flag it as a hazard. For the damage to your wheel, I can take your info and have someone call you about how to file a claim."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:06:33-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. I'd like that, since it's the city's road and..."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:06:37-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Somebody will call you at that number. Anything else today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:06:41-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T14:06:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Castillo. Take care."
    }
  ],
